        "description": "A rematch is a NEW duel restricted to the opponent of the one it came from. The service resolves that opponent itself \u2014 the payload carries no cross-room identity for it to be told. betRef is REQUIRED; the shipped widget client drops it (gap G2), so this route 400s from the widget today.",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"participant\": {\n    \"label\": \"Maksym K.\",\n    \"initials\": \"MK\",\n    \"balances\": {\n      \"eur\": 65\n    }\n  },\n  \"betRef\": {\n    \"id\": \"{{rematchBetId}}\",\n    \"number\": 12400\n  },\n  \"payload\": {\n    \"marketId\": \"total_goals\",\n    \"marketItemId\": \"total_goals_2.5\",\n    \"creatorSide\": {\n      \"outcomeId\": \"over\",\n      \"odd\": 182,\n      \"placement\": {\n        \"stake\": 10.0,\n        \"lineItemId\": \"li-12\",\n        \"dataVersion\": 7\n      }\n    },\n    \"opponentSide\": {\n      \"outcomeId\": \"under\",\n      \"odd\": 205\n    },\n    \"figures\": {\n      \"payout\": 0,\n      \"entry\": 0,\n      \"pot\": 0\n    }\n  }\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
